data/context_ingest/

# build artifacts + local analysis scratch (untracked lanes)
*.egg-info/
.osgrep/
analytics/
# live-DB dumps (may contain sealed values) — NEVER commit
live-dumps/

# env backups (live secrets) — NEVER commit
.env.bak*
# chat-sample breakdowns (real case PII; owner rule 2026-07-11: local + gitignored)
docs/planning/chat-sample-analysis/

# generated evidence-pipeline reports — they embed real message content (one sample
# row in the first generated report contained a name, DOB and SSN). The GENERATOR is
# tracked (scripts/evidence_pipeline_report.py); its output never is.
docs/reports/*
!docs/reports/README.md

# --- per-session agent scratch (2026-08-05) -------------------------------
# One-off memory-consolidation / inspection scripts written straight into the
# repo root by tooling sessions. They are session artifacts, not platform code:
# never imported, never tested, superseded by the next session's copy. Ignored
# rather than deleted (owner rule: never delete — these stay on disk).
.cleanup/
.consolidate.py
.consolidate_cnf.py
.inspect.py
consolidate_memories.py
scripts/_cnf_consolidate.py
scripts/_cnf_inspect.py
scripts/_inspect_mem.py
scripts/_e*.txt

# Codex CLI's per-repo config + hooks. Tool-specific setup lives in that tool's
# own config, never in this repo (AGENTS.md, "Further Reading").
.codex/

# vendored upstream clones pulled in for reading only (semantica et al). These
# carry their own .git; they are a research checkout, not a dependency.
.research/

# local DuckDB scratch DB for Iceberg/lakehouse poking (regenerable).
iceberg

# TODO snapshots emitted by the session tooling — a point-in-time dump of the
# in-flight task list, superseded on every run. The durable lane is
# docs/COORDINATION.md; HANDOFF-*.md carries what must survive.
docs/TODO-SNAPSHOT-*.json

# Auto-generated compaction summaries. These transcribe whole sessions VERBATIM,
# so anything the session handled in the clear lands in them — the 2026-08-02 and
# -08-03 files each carry live Cloudflare R2 API tokens (`cfat_…`) and the account
# id, 44 occurrences between them. Same reasoning as docs/reports/* above: the
# artifact embeds real secrets even though the process producing it is fine.
# HANDOFF-*.md stays tracked — it is written deliberately, not transcribed.
# COMPACT-SUMMARY-2026-08-01.md predates this rule, is already tracked, and was
# verified token-free; a tracked file is unaffected by this pattern either way.
docs/COMPACT-SUMMARY-*.md
# Owner-only quarantine. Files moved here are intentionally retained until the
# owner deletes them and may include credential-bearing application data.
to_be_deleted/
# CocoIndex Code (ccc)
/.cocoindex_code/

# Pre-edit snapshot convention (multi-agent sessions). Snapshots belong in _stale/,
# never alongside the live file, and never in git. Added 2026-08-23 during reconciliation.
*.backup_*

# local DuckDB databases (derived, rebuildable — e.g. npm community-node catalog)
.duckdb/
